  "2026-08-18T10:02:35.558Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: fresh search-advanced project contracts pass the 72-surface token ratchet at 16,107/15,981 bytes; structured get help returns usage get [options] <id>; focused suites, exact contracts/SDK snapshots, and 7,545-test 100/100/100/100 coverage pass. Local timing-only checks missed unchanged budgets by 2-48 ms under load average >8; hosted exact-head performance gates remain the admission authority."
  "2026-08-18T10:45:42.808Z","harness:codex","Late review implementation: default command_summaries are documented as registered paths rather than every virtual action row; all 27 plan/assurance paths remain discoverable through grammar contracts and command-scoped help. The token-surface ratchet now executes every virtual action help path and passes 99 measured surfaces in an isolated search-active tracker."
  "2026-08-18T10:56:55.213Z","harness:codex","Final verification evidence: the search-active ratchet now measures all 27 virtual positional-action help paths alongside registered command paths, for 99 total surfaces and 88 required baselines. It passed in an isolated temporary PM root, plus the command-scoped token budget and full 100/100/100/100 repository coverage (53,124 lines; 55,035 statements; 11,369 functions; 41,062 branches)."
